Thank you very much @connorads , it worked for me as well.
```
// ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json

{
  "mcp": {
    "figma": {
        "type": "remote",
        "url": "https://mcp.figma.com/mcp",
        "enabled": true
    }
  }
}
```

